<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<!--
  Hand-written miniature OSM extract used by pipelines/tests/test_gtfs.py.

  It is NOT downloaded: the GTFS builder tests must run offline against a
  committed fixture. It mirrors the shape of an NCR extract produced by the
  Task 5 bbox clip, including the accepted limitation that clipping can leave
  dangling relation members (members whose object is not in the extract).

  Nodes:
    1001  North Avenue        (14.6000, 121.0000)  MRT-3 stop, on way 2001
    1002  Quezon Avenue       (14.6050, 121.0050)  MRT-3 stop, ways 2001 + 2002
    1003  GMA Kamuning        (14.6100, 121.0100)  MRT-3 stop, on way 2002
    1004  Cubao               (14.6150, 121.0150)  bus stop, on way 2102
    1005  Baclaran            (14.5300, 121.0000)  bus stop, on way 2102
    1006  Guadalupe           (14.5650, 121.0450)  ferry pier, on way 2101
    1007  Pasig               (14.5750, 121.0600)  ferry pier, on way 2101
    1008  rail geometry only  (14.6025, 121.0025)
    1009  rail geometry only  (14.6075, 121.0075)
    1010  bus geometry only   (14.5700, 121.0100)

  Ways:
    2001  nodes 1001,1008,1002   railway=subway
    2002  nodes 1002,1009,1003   railway=subway   (shares node 1002 with 2001)
    2101  nodes 1006,1007        route=ferry
    2102  nodes 1004,1010,1005   highway=primary

  Relations:
    3001  route=light_rail, ref=MRT-3   -> rail-mrt3, route_type 1
          members: way 2001, way 8999 (DANGLING), way 2002,
                   node 1001/1002/1003 role=stop, node 9999 (DANGLING)
          The two dangling members must be skipped and counted; the shape must
          still resolve to five points 1001,1008,1002,1009,1003.
    3002  route=ferry, ref=Pasig        -> ferry-pasig, route_type 4
          members: way 2101 only, so its two landmark stops are synthesized
          from the from/to tags and the shape endpoints.
    3003  route=bus, ref=B1             -> bus-b1, route_type 3
          members: way 2102 + nodes 1004/1005 role=stop.
    3004  route=road, ref=R1            -> ignored: not a public-transport mode.
    3005  route=bus, ref=B2             -> bus-b2, but its only way member
          (8998) is dangling, so it has no resolvable geometry and no stops;
          build_feed must skip it and record the skip instead of crashing.
-->
<osm version="0.6" generator="biyahey-test-fixture">
